'''Denis '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[Codes|code]], "D3NIS". It is now only obtainable through trading as the code has since expired.

== Appearance ==
Denis has a teal blade and guard. The blade has mini cats and mini hearts as well, it also has his cat on the knife. The handle is solid black.
== Trivia == 
* This is 1 of 5 youtuber code knives. The others being [[Corl]], [[Sketchy]], [[Alex]] and [[Sub]], not including [[JD]], a very special [[Legendary Weapons|Legendary]] knife.
* Like every other [[Codes|code]], this code has expired.

